h4
  | Re-run the
  =< @action.parser
  |  parser for
  =< @object.workout_date
  | ? Only that parser will be tried (no fallback).
= form_tag url_for(action: @action.action_name, model_name: @abstract_model.to_param, id: @object.id), method: :post do
  .form-actions
    button.btn.btn-primary type="submit" data-disable-with="Re-run"
      i.fas.fa-check
      |  Re-run
